# Deprecated compatibility artifact
#
# Project aliases are not consumed or enforced by Docker Compose or by any
# script in this repository. Select the host-owned OpenCode workspace directly
# in the gitignored .env file instead:
#
#     OPENCODE_WORKSPACE_PATH=/absolute/path/to/disposable-workspace
#
# The workspace may contain one repository or multiple nested repositories.
# OpenCode can read and modify everything beneath that path. This file remains
# only to explain the migration for existing installations and may be removed in
# a future release.
